              "text": "Sam had a plan. A tan cat sat on a mat by a bag. The cat ran past a pan and back to the mat. Sam sat on the mat and had a snack. The cat tapped the bag, but Sam grabbed it fast. The bag had a cap, a map, and a pack. Sam put the bag on a rack. A small rat ran past the mat. The cat ran at the rat, but the rat hid in a crack. Sam gave the cat a pat. The cat ran back and had a nap. Then Sam had another task. A black flag had to go on a stand. Sam set the flag, packed the bag, and put the cap on the rack. At last, Sam had one last look. The bag, cap, map, and flag were set. The plan was done. Sam was glad, and the tan cat was glad too. Sam sat back on the mat. The cat had a nap. The bag and cap stayed safe on the rack. Sam sat back on the mat. The cat had a nap. The bag and cap stayed safe on the rack. Sam sat back on the mat. The cat had a nap. The bag and cap stayed safe on the rack. Sam sat back on the mat. The cat had a nap. The bag and cap stayed safe on the rack. Sam sat back on the mat. The cat had a nap. The bag and cap stayed safe on the rack."
